# screen.scn: the frame buffer through the runtime's XRAM rows, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# Rows 0 and 1 share XRAM's first line pair, row 15 ends the top bank and row 16 starts the bottom one, and row 31 is
# the last; each row has its first or last byte drawn. Two presents dump the frame, the second after redrawing.
draw 0 0 0x80
draw 0 5 0x01
draw 1 0 0xC3
draw 1 3 0x5A
draw 15 2 0xFF
draw 15 5 0x81
draw 16 0 0x18
draw 16 4 0x7E
draw 31 1 0x24
draw 31 5 0xA5
present
draw 0 0 0x00
draw 16 4 0x00
draw 31 0 0x42
present
